  "raw_text": "Step 1: Identify the number of choices for each component of the Mr. Potato Head personality.\n- Hairstyles: 3 choices (including being bald)\n- Eyebrows: 2 choices\n- Eyes: 1 choice (since there is only 1 pair of googly eyes)\n- Ears: 2 choices\n- Lips: 2 choices\n- Shoes: 2 choices\n\nStep 2: Calculate the total number of different combinations by multiplying the number of choices for each component.\nTotal combinations = 3 (hairstyles) × 2 (eyebrows) × 1 (eyes) × 2 (ears) × 2 (lips) × 2 (shoes)\n\nStep 3: Perform the multiplication to find the total number of different wacky personalities.\nTotal combinations = 3 × 2 × 1 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 48\n\nFinal answer: \\boxed{48}<|im_end|>",
